# Generated figures and tables. Both are outputs of the runners and are
# regenerated by run_all.sh, so they are no longer tracked -- the figs alone
# were 18 MB of binary PNG churning on every run, which is what made the
# history heavy. Regenerate rather than pull.
paper/experiments/figs/
paper/experiments/tables/